# ResearchSpec Mixed-License Notice

ResearchSpec is distributed under multiple licenses. A single SPDX identifier would not accurately describe the complete package.

## MIT-licensed material

Unless identified below as ARSU-derived material, ResearchSpec-authored source code, tests, documentation, Companion Skills, and command adapters are licensed under the MIT License, copyright 2026 ResearchSpec contributors. The complete text is in `LICENSES/MIT.txt`.

