The following material is adapted from Academic Research Skills (ARS), copyright 2026 Cheng-I Wu, and remains licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License:

- `vendor/ars/**`
- `skills/arsu/**`
- `src/arsu-converter/routing/catalog.ts`
- `src/arsu-converter/workflow/catalog.ts`
